# Purpose: keep local test/build artifacts out of the public repository.
# Inputs: files generated by Python, pytest, task-catalog runs, and local editors.
# Outputs: Git ignores only reproducible artifacts; source and Markdown remain trackable.
# Usage: applied automatically by Git from the repository root.

__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
.file-catalog/
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite3-shm
*.sqlite3-wal
.venv/
venv/
dist/
build/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
